CLAIM = for N in {3, 4}, every J >= 300 and every d_L = -1 row listed here, with <kind> the row's kind (D3B for D3, D4A for D4, D4MA for D4M; KEYMAP_<kind>): |E_semi| <= ||X* a|| <= N*_E_SEMI_HI_<kind> (equal to N*_Q_HI_<kind>), ||Q0 X_1* a-hat|| <= q1 = min(N*_Q1_HI_<kind>, Q(l(p - 2))) with Q(l(p - 2)) = |eps_W(l(p - 2))| + rn1(l(p - 2)) of S8's certified chain at the piece (record d7e9dc62; plane l(1) for D3B, l(0) for D4A and D4MA), and the near-end trick term is T <= s1 N*_Q_HI_<kind> (1 + s1/2 + q1) (sigma_g = 0); R6.5 takes q1 per piece and prints both sources; with s1 = s(1 + s) of the certified M2(b) law at the piece's J_lo. N*_Q_HI_D4MA already includes the J-uniform lambda_h/lambda_0 factor: R6.5 must not apply v3's LAMBDA_POWER_D4MA = 1/2 again.
KEYMAP_D3B = E N*_E_SEMI_HI_D3B ; Q N*_Q_HI_D3B ; Q1 N*_Q1_HI_D3B (rows of class D3)
KEYMAP_D4A = E N*_E_SEMI_HI_D4A ; Q N*_Q_HI_D4A ; Q1 N*_Q1_HI_D4A (rows of class D4)
KEYMAP_D4MA = E N*_E_SEMI_HI_D4MA ; Q N*_Q_HI_D4MA ; Q1 N*_Q1_HI_D4MA (rows of class D4M)
FORMULA_E = |E_semi| = |<u, X* a>| <= ||X* a|| <= Q_HI: Lemma B's crude form (D3B), A-D4's A4 (D4A), A-D4M's M3 (D4MA), as in v3
FORMULA_Q = Q_HI_D3B = QB_CRUDE, Q_HI_D4A = QA_CRUDE (D4A), Q_HI_D4MA = QA_CRUDE (D4MA) (1/(N*_I_FREE_LO N*_RQH_LO))^(1/2) (TAU_D3B_v1's J-uniform fallback)
FORMULA_Q1 = Q1_HI = g^(p - 1/2) N*_TAU_HI with g = (N*_RTR - 1 + N*_EPS_R_300)/(1 - N*_EPS_R_300), p = 3 (D3B), 2 (D4A, D4MA) (X_1 = S'^p, a = S'^-1 l(-1) in H, spectral gap); eps_r nonincreasing on [300, inf) (M2B CLAIM); recomputed here from the three keys as exact rationals, rounded outward to 12 significant digits (C-Q1), at or above the review ADD1 1d9806ef's outward constants (C-Q1X); the second source is X_1* a-hat = l(p - 2) exactly, bounded by S8's certified chain value Q(l(p - 2)) per piece (the review CONFIRM_X1_IDENTIFICATION_DLM1 c54b4a9c), about 10x sharper; q1 = min of the two
NOTE_C_BB = D3B's c_bb box is v3's cf fields of N*_D3B_R000
CORRECTION_ADD1_L21 = at d_L = -1, a = S'^-1 l(-1) IS in H: it is the type-B note's constant function (the review ff20ff69 step 1). This corrects pk02's SPEC_NEAR_END_TRICK_FLOAT_v1_ADD1 l.21 (687c46b7, the float spec's addendum: "not in H", "||Q0 a|| does not exist") and pk11's DESIGN_P2_12_v1_5 l.42 (1713cce3: "not in L^2"). The float spec's sigma_n with ||Q0 a|| (SPEC_NEAR_END_TRICK_FLOAT_v1 fae580d0 l.25) stays replaced by ADD1 l.26's form |E_semi| s' ||Q0 X_1* a-hat||, the quantity this block bounds; only l.21's reason changes
NOTE_X1 = X_1 is the window operator with insertion 1, centres 0 (ADD1 l.22's "f = 1" operator): D = <a, X_1 b>, a-hat is normalized by <a-hat, X_1 u> = 1, and N*_Q1_HI_<kind> and Q(l(p - 2)) bound ||Q0 X_1* a-hat|| for this X_1
